return readJson(file).ui ?? {};
```
For `zh`, the sidecar has origins. For other locales, no sidecar; new community entries (none) would need git blame. For now, if a community entry has no origin, error; we can derive later. The `community` files for other locales don't exist yet; only zh. Good.
